--------------------------------- KEY POINTS ---------------------------------

✓ Two independent stacks using separate arrays
✓ top1 = -1 represents empty stack1
✓ top2 = -1 represents empty stack2
✓ push increments top, pop decrements top
✓ Returns -1 on underflow (empty stack pop)
✓ Each stack has independent capacity (200 each)
✓ All operations O(1) time

Time: O(1) per operation | Space: O(2n) = O(n)

