1. push1(x) - Push x to stack1 (from left)
2. push2(x) - Push x to stack2 (from right)
3. pop1() - Pop from stack1, return -1 if empty
4. pop2() - Pop from stack2, return -1 if empty
5. twoStacks - Initialize the data structures and variables to be used to implement  2 stacks in one array.

